# this list should be formatted as fields like so:
# search query --scope=[day|week|month|any] --email=address@example.com
# spaces are handled gracefully
# quotes are explicit and parsed (i.e. passed to the search engine)
# missing scope defaults to 'any time'
# --email is required, otherwise line is ignored

# e.g.
# football --scope=day --email=alertaddress@example.com
# search query "with quotes" --email=alertaddress@example.com
# site:example.com search query --email=alertaddress@example.com

